    {
      "id": "p0172-b003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "In English, the Temmies speak in \"Temminese\" - an extremely unique dialect that can be described as an absolute disaster of the English language. Toby's explanation to the localization staff offers some details:",
        "raw": "In English, the Temmies speak in \"Temminese\" - an extremely unique dialect\nthat can be described as an absolute disaster of the English language. Toby's\nexplanation to the localization staff offers some details:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.2973858,
          0.2464,
          0.89352421,
          0.29467857
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29530496,
          0.24568571,
          0.90669262,
          0.29575
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          18,
          19,
          20
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "英语版中，Temmie 们说着“Temmie 语”：一种极其独特的方言，简直是英语的大灾难。Toby 给本地化人员的说明提供了一些细节：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.2976255,
          0.24497143,
          0.90465259,
          0.29825
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "justify",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.9242857142857143,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left"
      },
      "calibration": {
        "bbox": [
          0.2976255,
          0.24497143,
          0.90465259,
          0.29825
        ],
        "font_size": 20,
        "leading": 29.0
      },
      "review_issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "p0172-b004",
      "kind": "quote",
      "source": {
        "text": "Temmies are based off of how my friend Temmie talks, which is to say with a lot of typos and weird phrases. Kind ofl ike Mr. Saturn I guess but more like chatspeak. Temmies are generally all girls besides Bob I think.",
        "raw": "Temmies are based off of how my friend Temmie talks, which is to say with\na lot of typos and weird phrases. Kind ofl ike Mr. Saturn I guess but more\nlike chatspeak. Temmies are generally all girls besides Bob I think.",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.34176671,
          0.31112143,
          0.89550304,
          0.35946429
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.34044069,
          0.31040714,
          0.89682907,
          0.36053571
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          22,
          24,
          27
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "Temmie 们的说话方式，参考了我的朋友 Temmie：错字很多，措辞也很奇怪。大概有点像 Mr. Saturn，但更接近网络聊天语言。除了 Bob 之外，Temmie 应该基本都是女孩。",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
        "bbox": [
          0.34176671,
          0.30969286,
          0.90465259,
          0.36303571
        ],
        "font_size": 18.5,
        "line_height": 1.45,
        "font_weight": 450,
        "background": "transparent",
        "text_align": "left",
        "auto_height": true,
        "limit_bottom": 0.9242857142857143,
        "snap_to_guides": true,
        "resize_anchor": "left",
