    {
      "id": "p0172-b006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "source": {
        "text": "This unique butchery of the English language would be lost in a straightforward translation into Japanese. But because Temmies are so memorable and strange, the localization team spent weeks on creating a solid, Japanese equivalent of English Temminese. The resulting Japanese speech style included:",
        "raw": "This unique butchery of the English language would be lost in a\nstraightforward translation into Japanese. But because Temmies are so\nmemorable and strange, the localization team spent weeks on creating a solid,\nJapanese equivalent of English Temminese. The resulting Japanese speech\nstyle included:",
        "status": "corrected",
        "languages": [
          "en"
        ],
        "bbox": [
          0.297345,
          0.43792143,
          0.89663526,
          0.52215
        ],
        "mask_bbox": [
          0.29530496,
          0.43720714,
          0.90669262,
          0.52322143
        ],
        "line_ids": [
          31,
          34,
          36,
          38,
          39
        ]
      },
      "translation": {
        "text": "这种糟蹋英语的独特方式，直接翻译成日语就会消失。但 Temmie 们实在古怪而令人难忘，本地化团队为此花了好几周，打磨出与英语 Temmie 语相当的日语风格，包括：",
        "status": "draft",
        "spans": []
      },
      "annotations": [],
      "layout": {
